HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: DEAD RECKONING POSITION INTEGRATOR
BTW Propagates 2D coordinates from speed log and gyro compass
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A KNOTS_TO_MPS ITZ 0.514444

HOW IZ I STEP_DR_POSITION YR LAT AN YR SOG AN YR COG AN YR DT
    I HAS A SPD_MPS ITZ PRODUKT OF SOG AN KNOTS_TO_MPS
    I HAS A DIST_M ITZ PRODUKT OF SPD_MPS AN DT
    I HAS A DLAT ITZ QUOSHUNT OF DIST_M AN 111132.92
    FOUND YR SUM OF LAT AN DLAT
IF U SAY SO

